id: armor
name: Armor
kind: crafting
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Damage Reduction equal to the Apparel Bonus. Always the Top Layer, with nothing put on over it.
text: >
  Armor. Gain Damage Reduction equal to the Apparel Bonus. Armor must be the Top Layer of your
  Apparel and you cannot equip any piece of Apparel while wearing Armor.

---

# "Gain Damage Reduction equal to the Apparel Bonus" - while this piece is the Top Layer, which
# is the only piece whose Category part runs. `$armorFactor` is what its Qualities multiply the
# Damage Reduction by: Sleek Design's "Halve the Damage Reduction gained from this Armor".
[passive]
damageReduction += $apparelBonus(bT) * $armorFactor;

# "Armor must be the Top Layer of your Apparel and you cannot equip any piece of Apparel while
# wearing Armor" - kept by putting Apparel on, not here: Armor goes on the Top Layer alone, and
# while it is worn nothing else goes on but a piece that may be worn over Armor, the Jacket.
